# Gitleaks Ignore (Allowlist)

# --- Reserved paths for GitHub Actions & Runners ---
# Exclude the entire workspace directory to prevent scanning runner-specific files.
# Example: `^github/workspace/.*`

# --- Local Super-Linter paths ---
# Exclude temporary linting directories used during local execution.
# Example: `^tmp/lint/.*`

# --- Specific Files & Mock Data (Optional) ---
# Exclude test data, examples, or configurations that trigger false positives.
# Example: `^examples/.*`
# Example: `.*_test\.go`
